	<section_number>8.01-8</section_number>
	<catch_line>How minors may sue</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any minor entitled to sue may do so by his next friend. Either or both parents may sue on behalf of a minor as his next friend.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 8-87; 1977, c. 617; 1998, c. 402.</history>
</law>
